+/* 80-side — the tab panel (operator 2026-10-31 '적용하자': the approved layout after travel.webforai.kr;
+   templates/_side.html.j2, base.html.j2, en/_chrome.html.j2). The tone stays (00-tokens: white, hairline borders, sea
