+
+   From 1200px — the PC layout: the header is a white rounded board at the left (288px, 16px from the window's edges),
+   fixed while the page scrolls and scrolling inside itself when taller than the window (data-lenis-prevent: Lenis
+   leaves it its own wheel). In it, in reading and Tab order: the wordmark with its line, the language menu (a full-
+   width button; its list drops over the board), the site search (always shown, works without JS), the day card
+   (군산 날씨 · 해 뜨고 지는 시각 · 다음 행사), the two actions and the tab groups (nav.side-nav: <details> that open
+   without JS, the page's group open, its link aria-current). The bar's own buttons (AI 코스, 검색, 메뉴) step back: the
+   board has each of them. The page is a column right of the board (body padding; --cw its width, so the carousels' and
+   the story stage's 100vw sums use the column); the bars the old layout had at the top are gone (--bar 0), except a
+   page's local bar (place, course, event, guide: 52px, sticky in the column). The home's opening becomes a rounded
+   board in the column (the mock-up Main).
+   Why 1200px: at 1200 the column is 880px — about the 930px the desktop page layouts (from 1024px) were drawn for;
+   below it the board would squeeze them. From 1024 to 1199px the bar stays (60px) with the search field in it, its
+   nav row replaced by the menu, which opens the same groups as on phones.
+   Below 1200px: the bar as before (52px phones · 60px from 1024px; the fixed area ≤ 15% of the screen) and the menu
+   (details.menu, without JS too): the two actions, the groups (each a <details>; their links in two columns of 56px
+   cells), the day card without the weather module, then 검색 and the other versions.
+   Contrast (00-tokens head): ink on white 16.27; ink-2 9.36; ink-3 on white 5.62 / g0 5.22 / tint 4.98; sea-deep on
+   tint 7.13; white on ink 16.27. Targets ≥ 44px (the groups' rows 44–52px); the shared focus ring. */
+:root { --side-w: 288px; --side-in: 16px; --side-x: calc(var(--side-w) + 2 * var(--side-in)); }
+
+/* ---------------------------------------------------------------- the parts, any width */
+.wm-tag, .side { display: none; }
