+
+/* ---------------------------------------------------------------- 날씨각's weather module (_side.html.j2 weather,
+   assets/weather.js; operator 2026-10-31). Built: the title and the link to weather.o2o.kr. With JS the module keeps
+   the room of its filled state from the first paint, so nothing moves when the answer comes after load (or when it
+   does not: the link stays, in the same room). Contrast: ink on g0 15+; ink-2 on g0 8+; ink-3 on g0 5.22; sea-deep
+   7+. Icons: currentColor (the sun 4.6:1 amber, the rest ink-3 / sea-deep). */
+.wx { position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; padding: 12px 14px; color: var(--ink); }
+.wx-h { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; margin: 0; }
